## Fixed and verified this session (v0.11.76 → v0.11.81, all uncommitted per no-git rule)

1. **D9 (v0.11.77)** — "abort mount" didn't abort: DLM-init failure fell back to "continuing single-node," which mounted **both** nodes uncoordinated on one shared LUN. Now fail-closed (`-ENOTCONN`); verified via injection knob.
2. **D7 (v0.11.78)** — the 4.7–20s joiner stall was the 20s wall-clock membership-settle gate freezing every node's EX after any membership change. Fixed with a lease-beacon view-hash convergence proof: join wall 20.1s → **0.66s**, probe shows `waited=300ms confirmed=1`.
3. **D6 (v0.11.79)** — clean umount now broadcasts NODE_LEAVE: survivor's post-departure EX work went **38s → 10ms**, zero retry spam; real-death grace intact (fence/netpartition/membership green).
4. **D4 (v0.11.80)** — kernel v5 never PR-preempted dead peers at all. Added READ-KEYS-classified fencing before purge/remaster in both death paths, with a topology guard (the tcm_loop VM rig shares ONE I_T nexus across all VMs — per-node PR is impossible there and the unguarded version false-self-fenced the survivor). Double-unregister eliminated.
5. **D8 (v0.11.80)** — mount-time PR conformance probe + 30s periodic self-check; advisory latch verified on the shared-nexus rig, and on the cawp rig (real per-node nexuses): positive preempt verified (`P-PR-FENCE preempted`, victim key removed) plus the full fence resolution — preempted node's heartbeat bounced **EBADE within ~2s → withdraw shutdown, no re-register**.
6. **P125 holder leak (v0.11.81)** — ring-traced a leaked EX/PR holder to `ilock_end`'s single-node/`!dlm` early-returns skipping the decrement for multi-node-era begins; this class feeds the historic busy-inodes/teardown-corruption family. Deterministic repro went 2/2-failing → 2/2-clean.

Also fixed: run.sh's cluster marker (was recording PASSes against a stale build/wrong rig — now rig-aware + live-verified) and clyde's LIO `/etc/target/pr` (missing dir made every PR OUT fail-with-side-effects). Both VM boards (1/tcp, 2/tcp) re-validated green; CAW settle gate, racy join, and ghost-slot rescan all executed and verified on cawp. Awareness docs and 5 ccmemory entries updated.

